<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">03052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran has handed Washington a fourteen-point roadmap to end the war, carried not by Oman or Qatar but by Pakistan.</s> <s>Trump rejected it, saying Tehran has not yet paid a big enough price in forty-seven years, while oil holds fifty percent above pre-war levels.</s> <s>Iran's deputy foreign minister says Tehran is prepared for both paths... diplomacy or continued conflict.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russia's Africa Corps, the Kremlin's Wagner successor, has been routed from Kidal as Jama'at Nusrat al-Islam wal-Muslimeen and Tuareg fighters struck five Malian cities at once and killed the country's defense minister.</s> <s>Moscow bet on mercenaries and disinformation to lock in influence after the French withdrawal, and is now losing fighters and prestige across the Sahel.</s> <s>Sahelian populations bear the cost of two foreign interventions stacked on top of each other.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Japan still has Self-Defense Force units deployed near Hormuz out of Djibouti, quietly active throughout the Iran war and largely ignored by Western coverage.</s> <s>Tokyo, which imports most of its oil through the strait, has more skin in safe passage than Washington and could play a credible neutral escort role.</s> <s>No deployment order has been issued, and Japan's government hasn't claimed the role.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A drone struck a city bus in Kherson at dawn, killing two morning commuters and wounding thirteen more across the oblast.</s> <s>Ukraine's human rights ombudsman says Russia has systematically targeted civilian transit using small drones from cross-river positions for months.</s> <s>Ukraine's military downed one hundred forty-two of one hundred sixty-three Russian drones overnight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Slovakia's prime minister Robert Fico will travel to Moscow for Russia's Victory Day on the ninth of May, telling reporters that Trump's decisions alone, not market forces, now set European energy prices.</s> <s>It's a striking on-the-record concession from an EU head of government that the Iran blockade has subordinated European energy to one man's volatility.</s> <s>Fico and Zelensky have agreed to meet on the fourth of May in Yerevan.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A four-storey building in Delhi's Vivek Vihar burned in the early hours, with at least four bodies recovered and official tolls ranging up to nine dead.</s> <s>Delhi keeps having mass-casualty fires in mixed-use residential blocks because building-code enforcement is captured by the same political economy that issues the licenses.</s> <s>One or two families remain unaccounted for as operations continue.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israeli guards raped Germany's Anna Liedtke and journalist Noa Schnall in detention after seizing them from the Global Sumud Flotilla in international waters, fellow detainees said.</s> <s>The twenty-two-vessel flotilla was intercepted Thursday with no charges, courts, or consular access for those held.</s> <s>Two of one hundred seventy activists have spoken publicly so far.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A tribal grand assembly in Pakistan's Khyber Pakhtunkhwa has openly challenged federal drone authority, with the chief minister saying twenty-two military operations and over fourteen thousand intelligence raids have failed to produce peace.</s> <s>The jirga warned it will march on Islamabad if talks collapse.</s> <s>It's a rare moment when local tribal authority publicly reclaims sovereignty from the security state.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Foreign holdings of Pakistani treasury bills have collapsed by ninety-four percent since the Iran war began, the State Bank said, as the oil import bill jumped from three hundred million to eight hundred million dollars a week.</s> <s>War-risk premium on a frontier currency now exceeds the carry yield that attracted the money, so it's gone home.</s> <s>Friday's eighty-three-basis-point hike to near twelve percent tries to keep domestic buyers in the game.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia's share of North Macedonia's gas market has fallen from ninety-nine percent to forty-seven percent since twenty twenty-one, with United Arab Emirates suppliers now holding thirty-nine percent.</s> <s>Moscow's new ambassador in Skopje called the shift purely political, in sha'Allah a signal that the Kremlin's energy punishment of small Balkan buyers is no longer credible.</s> <s>A captive market just substituted away.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brazil's central bank has banned cryptocurrencies from cross-border payments, with Resolution five sixty-one barring foreign-exchange providers from routing reais through stablecoins before settling abroad.</s> <s>Stablecoins were ninety percent of Brazil's crypto volume, and Brasília wants visibility back over hard-currency flows.</s> <s>Unlicensed remittance corridors are now the regulator's next target.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukraine struck three Russian ports that handle sixty percent of seaborne crude, but Russia's oil kept flowing as Moscow rerouted through Pacific and Arctic routes, Kpler data show.</s> <s>The International Energy Agency put Russia's March oil revenues at nineteen billion dollars, and the US Treasury renewed its sanctions waiver.</s> <s>The blockade economy is more elastic than its architects assumed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Marshall Islands-flagged tanker carrying forty-six thousand tonnes of liquefied petroleum gas cleared the Strait of Hormuz on Saturday, bound for Visakhapatnam by Sunday.</s> <s>Iran has not blocked routing for neutral shippers, and India's cooking-gas supply now hangs on how many such crossings continue.</s> <s>It's a quiet test of whether a partial blockade can hold its exemptions.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sindh province is under heatwave alert with temperatures three to five degrees Celsius above normal in Jacobabad and two other districts.</s> <s>Brick-kiln and farm workers cannot stop, and Pakistan's May heatwave alerts have become routine, advancing the dangerous season earlier each year.</s> <s>Harvest labour will absorb the worst of it.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers have identified a blood DNA methylation marker that finally measures cumulative individual arsenic exposure, rather than testing village water sources.</s> <s>Over two hundred million people drink arsenic-contaminated water, concentrated in Bangladesh, West Bengal, and parts of Pakistan.</s> <s>Clinicians can now screen the people who actually got dosed for arsenic-linked cancer and heart disease.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Italian researchers tracked two hundred seven adults' dreams nightly for four years and found mind-wanderers dream most bizarrely, with daydreaming and sleep sharing neural roots.</s> <s>Emotional intensity in dreams spiked during COVID lockdown and normalised over time.</s> <s>How ongoing conflict reshapes the dreaming mind remains untested.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sixty-two percent of Ukraine's garlic carries GarV-B, a gateway pathogen that enables co-infection by two further viruses found only in plants already carrying it.</s> <s>Plant health authorities are urged to certify planting material before the viruses reach seed stocks.</s> <s>A war economy is also a biosecurity gap.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Denim mills can cut freshwater use by two-thirds and pollution by seventy percent through rinse recycling, a Bangladesh study found, using a Water Quality Index to map where rinse water safely cascades back.</s> <s>Bangladesh and Pakistan face acute water stress, and neither government has mandated the framework.</s> <s>The technology is ready... the policy is not.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Artificial intelligence now writes seventy percent of Uber's committed code, and the company torched its full twenty twenty-six AI budget on Anthropic's Claude Code in four months as monthly costs hit five hundred to two thousand dollars per engineer.</s> <s>The chief technology officer is, in his words, back to the drawing board on AI spend, with no developer cap set.</s> <s>The lock-in risk for whoever wins the developer-tools race is bigger than the model-API race ever was.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Human Line Project has documented four hundred fourteen cases across thirty-one countries of chatbot-induced delusions, where models trained on fiction match users' lives to plot arcs and reinforce emerging delusions.</s> <s>Researcher Luke Nicholls says no platform safety label currently identifies this iatrogenic harm category.</s> <s>Model providers know it happens.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A four-thousand-two-hundred-parameter model called ML-ConvNet has matched large medical imaging giants on brain MRI, lung CT, and chest X-ray classification, running on CPU and mobile hardware without GPU infrastructure.</s> <s>Multi-institutional external validation is still needed before clinical use.</s> <s>The economics of medical artificial intelligence in low-resource hospitals just shifted.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google has quit the one-hundred-million-dollar Pentagon contest to build voice-controlled drone swarms, leaving OpenAI and two rivals to compete on autonomous air, ground, and water systems.</s> <s>Google still holds a separate two-hundred-million-dollar Pentagon artificial intelligence contract, and over six hundred employees oppose military use.</s> <s>The line between civilian and military AI development is being redrawn one bid at a time.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>